# Go Standards

Use existing project patterns.

Do not introduce new architectures.

Follow:

Handler -> Service -> Repository

Use existing repository methods before creating new ones.

Use existing entities before creating new structs.

Prefer extending existing services over creating new services.

Avoid duplicate helpers.

Search for existing implementation before creating new implementation.

# Imports

Keep imports minimal.

Remove unused imports.

# Database

Repositories are the only layer allowed to access GORM directly.

Services must not execute raw SQL.

Handlers must not execute database queries.